# =============================================================================
# Variables to set in Vercel → Project → Settings → Environment Variables
# Production domain: https://global-social-connections.vercel.app
# Copy secrets from backend/.env.vercel (do not commit that file).
# =============================================================================

# Required (Production + Preview):
#   DATABASE_URL=<your external PostGIS URL>
#   APP_SECRET=<at least 32 random characters>
#   APP_ENV=production
#   APP_URL=https://global-social-connections.vercel.app
#   FRONTEND_URL=https://global-social-connections.vercel.app
#
# Optional:
#   CSRF_SECRET
#   SUPABASE_URL
#   SUPABASE_SERVICE_KEY
#   SMTP_*
#
# Do not set PORT in the Vercel UI unless you intentionally override it.
#
# See DEPLOY.md for full steps.
